{"id":1419822171,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNDE5ODIyMTcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/priority/critical","name":"priority/critical","color":"ad1445","default":false,"description":"Critical issue"},{"id":4199362411,"node_id":"LA_kwDOBlCVUc76TS9r","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/2.14%20Backport%20Required","name":"2.14 Backport Required","color":"bfdadc","default":false,"description":""},{"id":4721920290,"node_id":"LA_kwDOBlCVUc8AAAABGXLJIg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/2.16%20Backport%20Required","name":"2.16 Backport Required","color":"24F4C7","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":{"login":"sanketkedia","id":14816236,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODE2MjM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14816236?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanketkedia","html_url":"https://github.com/sanketkedia","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanketkedia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanketkedia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanketkedia/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanketkedia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanketkedia/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanketkedia/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanketkedia/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanketkedia/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanketkedia/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"sanketkedia","id":14816236,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODE2MjM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14816236?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanketkedia","html_url":"https://github.com/sanketkedia","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanketkedia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanketkedia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanketkedia/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanketkedia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanketkedia/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanketkedia/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanketkedia/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanketkedia/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanketkedia/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2023-02-16T20:04:44Z","updated_at":"2023-06-08T17:24:45Z","closed_at":"2023-06-08T17:24:44Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-5576](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-5576)\r\n### Description\n\nIf a set of values from a sequence is cached on a connection, and then a PITR is performed that changes the current value of the sequence, the connection's cache is not cleared. This leads to duplicate values.\r\n\r\nBelow is a minimal reproduction. Use 2 shells, one for yb-admin and one for ysqlsh:\r\n\r\n```\r\n$ ./bin/yb-ctl start --tserver_flags=\"ysql_sequence_cache_minval=2\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\n$ ./bin/ysqlsh\r\nysqlsh# CREATE DATABASE test;\r\nysqlsh# exit\r\n$ ./bin/ysqlsh -d test\r\ntest# CREATE SEQUENCE s;\r\ntest# SELECT nextval('s');\r\nnextval \r\n---------\r\n       1\r\n(1 row)\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\n$ ./bin/yb-admin -master_addresses 127.0.0.1:7100 create_snapshot_schedule 2 10 ysql.test\r\n# keep track of the schedule id returned\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\ntest# SELECT nextval('s');\r\nnextval \r\n---------\r\n       2\r\n(1 row)\r\n\r\ntest# SELECT nextval('s');\r\nnextval \r\n---------\r\n       3\r\n(1 row)\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\n# wait 1 minute to pass from the time you created the schedule\r\n./bin/yb-admin -master_addresses 127.0.0.1:7100 restore_snapshot_schedule [schedule id from above] minus 1m\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\ntest# SELECT nextval('s');\r\nnextval \r\n---------\r\n       4\r\n(1 row)\r\n\r\ntest# SELECT nextval('s');\r\nnextval \r\n---------\r\n       3\r\n(1 row)\r\n```\r\n\r\nNotice the duplicate value; we've already retrieved 3.\n\n[DB-5576]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-5576?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","closed_by":{"login":"sanketkedia","id":14816236,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODE2MjM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14816236?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanketkedia","html_url":"https://github.com/sanketkedia","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanketkedia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanketkedia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanketkedia/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanketkedia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanketkedia/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanketkedia/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanketkedia/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanketkedia/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanketkedia/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/16137/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/16137/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"comp